</section>
</section>
<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5 </span>Conclusion</h2>

<div id="S5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We introduced DAC-SE1, an LM-based SE framework that operates directly on DAC tokens, achieving high-fidelity speech enhancement without auxiliary encoders or multi-stage pipelines. Experiments demonstrate that DAC-SE1 outperforms prior LM-based SE methods across objective metrics and in human evaluations. Our results show that speech enhancement methods benefit from scaling laws, a trend we expect will shape the next generation of SE models.</p>
</div>
</section>
